# The image is built from the repository root (apps/web/Dockerfile) and needs only
# apps/web, packages/contracts, the fonts and the workspace manifests.
**/node_modules
**/.next*
**/.DS_Store
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.github
.claude
apps/mobile
packages/signal-engine
# The stylesheet takes its fonts from the design system; nothing else there is needed.
design-system/*
!design-system/fonts
docs
eval
hardware
infra
scripts
recordings
apps/web/recordings
apps/web/.models
*.md
*.docx
